class Cashier(private val n:Int,private val discount:Int,products:IntArray,values:IntArray){private var counter=0;private val prices=products.indices.associate{products[it] to values[it]};fun getBill(product:IntArray,amount:IntArray):Double{var total=0.0;for(i in product.indices)total+=prices.getValue(product[i])*amount[i];counter++;return if(counter%n==0)total*(100-discount)/100.0 else total}}
